### Configuração
# @name config
# Rodando local (npm run dev, usa backend/.env -> PORT=3002).
# Se estiver testando contra o docker-compose, troque para http://localhost:3000
@baseUrl = http://localhost:3000

### Login (necessário para obter o cookie usado nas rotas abaixo)
# @name login
POST {{baseUrl}}/auth/login
Content-Type: application/json

{
    "email": "teste@estudyia.com",
    "password": "senha123"
}

### Criar usuário
# @name createUser
POST {{baseUrl}}/users
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "name": "Usuario Teste",
  "email": "teste@estudyia.com",
  "password": "senha123"
}

### Usuário autenticado (usa o cookie accesToken devolvido pelo login acima)
# @name me
GET {{baseUrl}}/users/me
Cookie: accesToken={{login.response.headers.Set-Cookie}}

### Buscar usuário por id
# @name getUserById
GET {{baseUrl}}/users/{{me.response.body.user.id}}
Cookie: accesToken={{login.response.headers.Set-Cookie}}

### Atualizar usuário
# @name updateUser
PATCH {{baseUrl}}/users/{{me.response.body.user.id}}
Content-Type: application/json
Cookie: accesToken={{login.response.headers.Set-Cookie}}

{
  "name": "Usuario Teste Atualizado"
}

### Deletar usuário
# @name deleteUser
DELETE {{baseUrl}}/users/{{me.response.body.user.id}}
Cookie: accesToken={{login.response.headers.Set-Cookie}}
